  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ending Violence, Abuse and Exploitation of Children (EVAEC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will provide &#xA3;15 million over three years to prevent and respond to violence, abuse and exploitation of children in support of Sustainable Development Goal 16.2. It will fund an international movement to build political will, strengthen collaboration and accelerate action to protect the world&#x2019;s vulnerable children. Through strategic partnerships with specialist agencies it will also address the particular vulnerabilities of children on the move, reducing their risk of exposure to forms of modern slavery.</narrative>
  </description>
